    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i'm looking at this house in seattle and the contract keeps mentioning \"escrow\" and an \"escrow agent\"... i'm a bit confused. what actually happens with the money while we're waiting to close? like who is holding it and why?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
